{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56623","headline":"唐武德祷雨辟邪镔铁镜铭 · 无名氏","name":"唐武德祷雨辟邪镔铁镜铭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"镔铁作镜辟大旱，清泉虔祀甘霖感，魅孽当前惊破胆，服之疫疠莫能犯。\n双龙嚄略垂长颔，回禄睢盱威早敛。\n（见《唐文拾遗》卷六二引《湘烟录》。\n铭末署：「武德壬午，造辟邪花镔铁镜。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}